OL,3,GNEWSAI can't tell you how horrible
OL,4,Afighting to save my home has been
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarion Maltwood has lived in her home
OL,7,Ffor 56 years - it was where she brought
OL,8,Fup three children and where her
OL,9,Fyoungest son was born.
OL,11,FNext week she resumes the fight to save
OL,12,Fit from demolition.
OL,14,FAlong with her late husband, she moved
OL,15,Ffrom London to a brand new house on the
OL,16,FAbbey Estate in Thetford, Norfolk, in
OL,17,F1970.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
